{
  "id": "the-simpsons---4x18---so-its-come-to-this-a-simpsons-clip-showen",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 4x18 - So It's Come to This  A Simpsons Clip Show.en",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 4x18 - So It's Come to This  A Simpsons Clip Show.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-08-31T04:14:29.514Z",
  "lineCount": 265,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "[Chorus] ## The Simpsons ##",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 2995,
      "endMs": 6294
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "[Bell Ringing]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 17076,
      "endMs": 18976
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "[Whistle Blowing]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 23849,
      "endMs": 26909
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "[ Beeping ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 29388,
      "endMs": 31288
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "## [Jazzy Solo ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 37029,
      "endMs": 38997
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "[ Beeping ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 59018,
      "endMs": 60918
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "[ Tires Screeching ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 61020,
      "endMs": 62920
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "D'oh! [ Screams ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 64290,
      "endMs": 66281
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "[ Ringing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 81240,
      "endMs": 83208
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Oh, no! I can't see. I'm blind. Blind!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 84343,
      "endMs": 87471
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Ha, ha! April Fools'.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 88747,
      "endMs": 91682
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "[Rooster Crowing]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 91784,
      "endMs": 94446
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Yeah. Yeah. [ Gagging ] Ha, ha! April Fools'.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 94553,
      "endMs": 100291
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "I've been keeping that carton of milk next to the furnace for six weeks. Sucker!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 100392,
      "endMs": 104692
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "You're goin' down, Homer. I'm gonna fool you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 104797,
      "endMs": 107265
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "You talk better than you fool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 107366,
      "endMs": 109266
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "I'll fool you up real nice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 109368,
      "endMs": 111427
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "You couldn't fool your mother on the foolingest day of your life... if you had an electrified fooling machine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 111537,
      "endMs": 116341
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "P.U! [ Groans ] Ah, what noble visionary thought up April Fools' Day?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 118244,
      "endMs": 125780
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Like Halloween and Christmas, April Fools' Day traces its origins to pagan ritual.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 125885,
      "endMs": 130447
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "God bless those pagans.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 130556,
      "endMs": 132456
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "April first used to be the pagan new year.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 132558,
      "endMs": 135584
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "[Drums Drumming] [Chanting]Blood for Baal!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 135694,
      "endMs": 138720
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Blood for Baal!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 138831,
      "endMs": 140822
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Blood for Baal!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 140933,
      "endMs": 143026
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "[Lisa's Voice] The Christians changed their calendar and ridiculed those who didn't.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 143135,
      "endMs": 147128
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Happy New Year! Hi-ho, pagans.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 147239,
      "endMs": 150174
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "New Year's was three months ago, but here's a present anyhoo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 150276,
      "endMs": 153370
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "It's ram's blood for your godless ceremony.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 153479,
      "endMs": 156107
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "[ Both Screaming ] [Ned Laughing]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 157349,
      "endMs": 159249
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "April Fools'! [ Laughing ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 159351,
      "endMs": 163082
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "[ Growls ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 163188,
      "endMs": 165156
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "[ Chanting ] Now who's laughing? Now who's laughing?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 165257,
      "endMs": 168818
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "And that's the story of April Fools' Day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 168928,
      "endMs": 172091
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Dad, I was telling the story. Oh, right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 172197,
      "endMs": 175394
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "[ Neon Buzzing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 175501,
      "endMs": 177992
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Thar she blows. The catch of the day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 179571,
      "endMs": 183234
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Arr, har, har, har, har, har, har, har.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 183342,
      "endMs": 187540
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Why, ye mutinous dogs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 187646,
      "endMs": 189546
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "From this day, I be requiring hairnets.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 189648,
      "endMs": 192549
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Arr. Arr. Arr.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 192651,
      "endMs": 195017
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Got to fool him before the day is out. But how?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 196655,
      "endMs": 200955
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "He must have a weakness.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 201060,
      "endMs": 203324
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Ah, beer, my one weakness. My Achilles' heel, if you will.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 203429,
      "endMs": 208230
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Beer. Beer is the cheese. But how to use it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 208334,
      "endMs": 212270
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Whoo! It's a good thing that beer wasn't shaken up any more... or I'd have looked quite the fool, an April fool, as it were.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 214473,
      "endMs": 221779
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "[Homer Chuckling] [ Evil Laugh ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 221880,
      "endMs": 225213
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "[Machine Rattling]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 225317,
      "endMs": 227182
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Hey, kid, that's for customers only.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 228287,
      "endMs": 230414
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Uh, did you know there's a guy outside handing out free Stri-Dex pads?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 230522,
      "endMs": 234117
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Wow! I'm in pizza-face paradise! Moron.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 234226,
      "endMs": 238185
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "[ Rattling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 240499,
      "endMs": 242433
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "�Ay! No es bueno.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 252244,
      "endMs": 255042
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "So thirsty. Eh, what are you gonna do?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 257249,
      "endMs": 260741
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "[ Growls ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 261820,
      "endMs": 263720
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "[ Water Boiling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 269161,
      "endMs": 271493
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "[ Announcer] The following is a public service announcement.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 275934,
      "endMs": 277925
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Excessive alcohol consumption can cause liver damage... and cancer of the rectum.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 278037,
      "endMs": 282873
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Mmm, beer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 282975,
      "endMs": 285671
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "[ Tearing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 285778,
      "endMs": 287837
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Hmm. [ Chuckles ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 292184,
      "endMs": 294209
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "April Foo--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 296321,
      "endMs": 299154
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "That sounded like an explosion at the old Simpson place.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 301260,
      "endMs": 304093
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Forget it. That's two blocks away.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 304196,
      "endMs": 306096
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Looks like there's beer coming out of the chimney.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 306198,
      "endMs": 308928
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "I am proceeding on foot. Call in a code eight.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 309034,
      "endMs": 311764
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "We need pretzels. Repeat-- pretzels.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 311870,
      "endMs": 314600
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "[ Panting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 314706,
      "endMs": 318164
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "[Door Closes]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 322347,
      "endMs": 324247
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Mrs. Simpson, I'm afraid your husband is dead. [ Gasps ] [ Laughing ] April Fools'. He's very much alive...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 324349,
      "endMs": 333257
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "although I'm afraid he may never walk again. [ All Gasping ] ## [ Singing ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 333358,
      "endMs": 339796
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Homie! Marge!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 339898,
      "endMs": 341991
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Mmm-mmm!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 342101,
      "endMs": 344729
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Homer has many, many horrible problems.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 344837,
      "endMs": 347431
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "These shadows are brain lesions resulting from numerous blows to the head.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 347539,
      "endMs": 352067
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "[ Grunts ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 352177,
      "endMs": 354873
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Ohh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 354980,
      "endMs": 356880
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "[ Snoring ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 359952,
      "endMs": 362546
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Wow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 364923,
      "endMs": 366857
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Huh? [ Screams ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 366959,
      "endMs": 370690
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "[ Gurgling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 378971,
      "endMs": 381565
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "And his brain waves are disturbingly erratic.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 390349,
      "endMs": 393250
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "[Man] You are wired in to the rest of your family.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 393352,
      "endMs": 396378
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "You have the ability to shock them and they have the ability to shock-- just testing-- Whoa!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 396488,
      "endMs": 404187
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Bart, how could you shock your little sister?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 404296,
      "endMs": 407026
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "My finger slipped-- Ahh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 407132,
      "endMs": 409259
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "So did mine-- [ Yelps ] Bart, Lisa, stop that!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 409368,
      "endMs": 414572
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "[Man]No, no! No! No, wait a minute!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 417609,
      "endMs": 420544
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Wait! Wait! Folks! Folks, if I could-- Uh, uh-- This is not the way to get healthy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 420646,
      "endMs": 426810
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "[Yelling Continues]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 426919,
      "endMs": 429820
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "[Simpsons Yelling]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 429922,
      "endMs": 431822
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Mrs. Simpson, can you think of anything to account for all this?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 433425,
      "endMs": 436451
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Mm, I have no idea.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 436562,
      "endMs": 438462
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Unless it was that time he kept falling down the cliff.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 438564,
      "endMs": 442159
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "I won't jump anymore. I promise.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 442267,
      "endMs": 444462
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Oh, thank God! Thank God! Thank God!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 444570,
      "endMs": 448165
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "I love you, Dad. I love you too, son.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 448273,
      "endMs": 451140
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "You know, boy, I don't think I've ever felt as close to you as I do right-- Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 451243,
      "endMs": 456306
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Wha-Wha-- Huh? Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 456415,
      "endMs": 458406
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "[ Yelling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 458517,
      "endMs": 461145
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Uhh! [ All Oohing ] I'm gonna make it. I'm gonna make it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 461253,
      "endMs": 466849
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "This is the greatest thrill of my life! I'm king of the world!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 466959,
      "endMs": 470087
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Whoo-hoo! Whoo-hoo! I-- [ Yelling ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 470195,
      "endMs": 474256
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "[Grunting, Groaning]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 474366,
      "endMs": 476459
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "[Groaning]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 479504,
      "endMs": 481404
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "[ Moaning ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 483275,
      "endMs": 485175
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Ow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 485277,
      "endMs": 487245
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Ow! Ow! Ow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 491516,
      "endMs": 495043
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "[ Siren Blaring ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 497489,
      "endMs": 499821
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "[Yelling, Groaning]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 502127,
      "endMs": 505893
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Ahh-- Ow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 511403,
      "endMs": 513371
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Hmm. That still wouldn't explain what I'm seeing here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 514740,
      "endMs": 517436
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "You look familiar. Have we met before? Um--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 517542,
      "endMs": 521103
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Clear! Clear!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 526685,
      "endMs": 529882
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Doctor, he's gone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 529988,
      "endMs": 531956
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Oh! This is the part of the job I hate.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 532057,
      "endMs": 535185
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] You're a veterinarian?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 537929,
      "endMs": 540261
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "That's right. And for an extra $20...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 540365,
      "endMs": 542458
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "I'll give Homer a tick bath and then spay him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 542567,
      "endMs": 544762
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "Here you go, Doc. Bart!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 544870,
      "endMs": 546770
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Shop around. You can't beat that price.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 546872,
      "endMs": 549170
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "You guys must have been pretty worried about me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 549274,
      "endMs": 551834
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Hey, we know you're tough, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 551943,
      "endMs": 553843
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Remember that time you got lost in the forest?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 553945,
      "endMs": 556379
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "This is a trap. It's gonna catch us our dinner. Come on, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 559851,
      "endMs": 563218
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Shh! Just watch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 563322,
      "endMs": 566223
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Ooh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 568327,
      "endMs": 570158
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Aha! Got 'em!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 571496,
      "endMs": 573361
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "[Thud]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 577102,
      "endMs": 579002
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Okay, okay. This time I'll just go into the bushes over there... make a lot of noise and flush out a rabbit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 579104,
      "endMs": 585870
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "And when he comes out, you step on him. Right, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 585977,
      "endMs": 589743
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "[Chittering] - Ahh! Get 'em off me! Get 'em off me! Get 'em off me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 591917,
      "endMs": 595375
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "[ Yelling ] [ Growling, Chittering ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 595487,
      "endMs": 597819
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "It's true. You have good coping skills.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 603295,
      "endMs": 606526
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Your burgers are getting cold, guys-- Holy Moly!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 617509,
      "endMs": 621546
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "[ Screaming ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 626051,
      "endMs": 628110
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "[ Screaming ] [ Screaming ] Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 628220,
      "endMs": 633717
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "And there's one Itchy and Scratchy cartoon I don't think we'll ever forget.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 647239,
      "endMs": 651198
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "[ Screams ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 652244,
      "endMs": 653541
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Why'd you bring that up? It was an amusing episode... of our lives.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 663889,
      "endMs": 669259
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Thanks for coming to visit me, Moe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 669361,
      "endMs": 671921
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "I, uh, brought you a little present. No! No! Beer bring pain!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 672030,
      "endMs": 676364
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "I can't stand to see him like this!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 676468,
      "endMs": 679266
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "[ Yelling ] [ Muffled Yelling ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 679371,
      "endMs": 683102
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "[ Grunting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 688380,
      "endMs": 691008
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "He really needs a girlfriend.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 698323,
      "endMs": 700883
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Oh, Marge, what if I wind up as some vegetable... watching TV on the couch?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 700992,
      "endMs": 707229
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "My important work will never be completed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 707332,
      "endMs": 710062
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Society's loss, I suppose.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 710168,
      "endMs": 712659
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "But our marriage has been through hard times, and we always pull through.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 712771,
      "endMs": 717105
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Huh? Huh? Hmm?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 741166,
      "endMs": 742997
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Marge! What a lovely surprise.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 743101,
      "endMs": 745899
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "You're here to see me, right? Of course.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 746004,
      "endMs": 749371
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "[Men Cheering, Applauding] [ Kiss ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 749474,
      "endMs": 752466
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Hey, way to go, Homer! Way to go!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 758083,
      "endMs": 762315
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Hey, what'll I tell the boss?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 762420,
      "endMs": 764149
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Tell him I'm going to the backseat of my car with the woman I love... and I won't be back for 1 0 minutes!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 764256,
      "endMs": 772822
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "[Cheering, Applauding]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 772931,
      "endMs": 775422
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "You can do it, Homer. Standup. I can't.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 780572,
      "endMs": 783939
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "[ Sighs ] He just won't budge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 784042,
      "endMs": 785942
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "I've tried everything. Nothing can reach him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 786044,
      "endMs": 788911
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Mmm. Chocolate.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 793385,
      "endMs": 797549
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "[Thinking] Chocolate. Chocolate.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 797656,
      "endMs": 801217
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Mmm!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 816875,
      "endMs": 818843
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "[ Barks, Whimpering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 827018,
      "endMs": 830215
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Wow! Chocolate. Half price.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 835694,
      "endMs": 839027
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "[ Moaning ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 844402,
      "endMs": 846393
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Chocolate. [Moaning]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 846504,
      "endMs": 849735
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "[ Growls, Yelling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 855780,
      "endMs": 859181
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Can't breathe. Sweet chocolate... cutting off air.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 861620,
      "endMs": 866250
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "[ Gagging ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 866358,
      "endMs": 869259
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Mmm! Nuts. [ Gagging ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 869361,
      "endMs": 873388
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "[Gagging Continues]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 873498,
      "endMs": 876399
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "[Swallows] Oh, yeah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 876501,
      "endMs": 878970
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Poor Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 881573,
      "endMs": 883268
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "This world was never meant for one as beautiful as you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 883375,
      "endMs": 887311
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "[ Drooling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 887412,
      "endMs": 889471
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "[ Yells ] Kill it! Kill it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 889581,
      "endMs": 891776
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Grampa, please. He's in a coma. Coma? Pfftt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 891883,
      "endMs": 895979
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Why, I go in and out of comas all the-- [ Snores ] French toast, please.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 896087,
      "endMs": 902890
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Is a coma painful? Oh, heck no!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 902994,
      "endMs": 905827
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "You relive long-lost summers, kiss girls from high school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 905930,
      "endMs": 910060
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "It's like one of those TV shows where they show a bunch of clips from old episodes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 910168,
      "endMs": 914332
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Mm. Yeah, well, anyway, I wonder what he's thinking now?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 914439,
      "endMs": 918705
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "[ Snoring ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 959684,
      "endMs": 961584
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "This man is costing my health plan $5,000 a day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 963088,
      "endMs": 966717
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "I demand that he die with dignity.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 966825,
      "endMs": 969521
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "[ Grunts ] Now, look, I'm the doctor here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 969627,
      "endMs": 972460
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Well, I demand a second opinion.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 972564,
      "endMs": 974498
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Hi, everybody! [ All ] Hi, Dr. Nick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 974599,
      "endMs": 978228
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "[ Whimpers ] Oh, dear. I see no signs of life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 978336,
      "endMs": 982773
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "-Just to be safe, we better pull the plug. Yoink!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 982874,
      "endMs": 986776
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Mr. Burns, how can you be so coldhearted?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 986878,
      "endMs": 989938
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "You have no idea, woman, what that man's put me through.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 990048,
      "endMs": 994178
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Uh, Mr. Burns, I need to borrow some money.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 995487,
      "endMs": 998012
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Oh, please, do go on. I know you're a good man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 998123,
      "endMs": 1001752
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "And I have a dog that's very sick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1001860,
      "endMs": 1004420
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Oh, please, continue.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1005663,
      "endMs": 1007631
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "I thought maybe you-- Oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1007732,
      "endMs": 1011327
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Well, thanks for your time. Hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1011436,
      "endMs": 1014371
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "I have an unorthodox solution-- a fantastic voyage, if you will.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1016040,
      "endMs": 1019976
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "[ Chuckles ] Three scientists-- one a beautiful woman-- will be shrunk to microscopic size.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1020078,
      "endMs": 1026482
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "They will then rendezvous in Mr. Simpson's lower colon. - [ All ] Ew!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1026584,
      "endMs": 1031749
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Well, we have had a little trouble finding volunteers. [ Chuckles ] I wish I'd gotten to know you better, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1031856,
      "endMs": 1040160
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "But there were times when we really connected.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1040265,
      "endMs": 1043029
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "####[Saxophone] Hi, Dad. Want me to cut out this infernal racket?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1043134,
      "endMs": 1048197
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Oh, let me hear you play. Why?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1048306,
      "endMs": 1050570
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Does a father have to explain?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1050675,
      "endMs": 1052575
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Let's just share your gift, okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1052677,
      "endMs": 1055202
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "## [ Blues ] Oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1055313,
      "endMs": 1060341
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "[ Sobbing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1060451,
      "endMs": 1064854
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "## [ Upbeat Jazz ] Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1064956,
      "endMs": 1067516
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Yeah! That's more like it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1067625,
      "endMs": 1070560
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Ho ho. Whoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1070662,
      "endMs": 1073563
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "## [ Singing ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1073665,
      "endMs": 1078159
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "####[Singing Continues] I wrote this for you, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1084475,
      "endMs": 1089379
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "## [ Mellow Jazz ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1089480,
      "endMs": 1092381
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Dad, I'm so sorry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1105263,
      "endMs": 1108130
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "I know I haven't been a perfect kid.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1108233,
      "endMs": 1110463
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "[Rumbling] [ Gasps ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1129220,
      "endMs": 1130949
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Why, you little-- ## [ Action Movie Theme ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1131055,
      "endMs": 1134684
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "What the-- D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1143868,
      "endMs": 1146496
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "[Horn Honking] [ Laughing ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1159217,
      "endMs": 1161879
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "[Jabbering Incoherently]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1166791,
      "endMs": 1170056
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "I know that I got you mad once in a while.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1170161,
      "endMs": 1173062
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "D'oh! D'oh! D'oh! D'oh! D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1173164,
      "endMs": 1175132
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "D'oh! D'oh! D'oh! D'oh! D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1175233,
      "endMs": 1177428
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "D'oh! D'oh! D'oh! D'oh! D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1177535,
      "endMs": 1179765
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "D'oh! D'oh! D'oh! D'oh! D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1179871,
      "endMs": 1182032
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "D'oh! D'oh! D'oh! D'oh! D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1182140,
      "endMs": 1184506
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "D'oh! D'oh! D'oh! D'oh! D'oh! D'oh! D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1184609,
      "endMs": 1187942
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "And sometimes I got into trouble.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1188046,
      "endMs": 1190480
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "[Clanking]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1191916,
      "endMs": 1195647
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Bart, you can't go on like this. I know. [ Coughs ] But you always looked out for me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1197555,
      "endMs": 1204918
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "[Marge]Homer, it's really coming down! Could you check on the boys?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1205029,
      "endMs": 1209523
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "[ Thunderclap ] They're fine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1209634,
      "endMs": 1214037
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "And no matter what happens, I'll never forget the advice you gave me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1214138,
      "endMs": 1219166
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "Now come on, you're gonna learn how to shave.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1219277,
      "endMs": 1221211
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "And finally, the little spot under your nose.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1221312,
      "endMs": 1226682
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Next, we take some toilet paper... tear off some teensy little squares... and stick one there and there and anyplace you're bleeding.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1226784,
      "endMs": 1237617
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "There and there. Don't worry. The blood'll hold it right on your face.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1237729,
      "endMs": 1241187
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "And now, some aftershave.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1241299,
      "endMs": 1244029
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "[ Yelling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1244135,
      "endMs": 1247002
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "Son of a-- Ohh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1249107,
      "endMs": 1251075
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "And that's how we shave.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1251175,
      "endMs": 1253575
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Dad, it's all my fault.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1253678,
      "endMs": 1255703
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "I shook up that can of beer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1255813,
      "endMs": 1258281
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "It was just an April Fools' joke.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1258383,
      "endMs": 1260351
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "[ Beeping ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1260451,
      "endMs": 1263477
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "[ Growling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1266090,
      "endMs": 1269253
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "[ Beeping Faster]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1269360,
      "endMs": 1272193
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Why, you little-- [ Gagging ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1274098,
      "endMs": 1276396
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "Homie, you're all right! We're a family again!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1276501,
      "endMs": 1280028
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "[ Gagging ] [ Growling ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1280138,
      "endMs": 1282971
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "This calls for a celebration.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1286944,
      "endMs": 1289105
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "We're all going to Hawaii. [ All Gasping ] [ Laughing ] Gotcha! It's April Fools' for two more minutes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1289213,
      "endMs": 1296282
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "Dad, it's May 1 6.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1296387,
      "endMs": 1298287
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "You were in that coma for seven weeks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1298389,
      "endMs": 1300550
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Uh-huh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1301926,
      "endMs": 1304121
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "[ All Laughing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1304228,
      "endMs": 1306753
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "You lost five percent of your brain.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1311069,
      "endMs": 1313629
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Me lose brain? Uh-oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1313738,
      "endMs": 1315899
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "[ All Laughing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1316007,
      "endMs": 1319204
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Why I laugh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1322580,
      "endMs": 1324548
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "[ People Chattering ] Shh! www.tvsubtitles.net",
